			byte of the payload structure identifier to indicate the
			composition of the OPUk signal. Gets the payload type
			that is put into the outgoing OTU2/OTU1 datastream.
			-----------------------------
			ommp81PlusInterfaceNumber:
			1 to 8 - CLIENT-1 to CLIENT-8
			9 - LINE-1
