			gives the count of Primitive Sequence Insertions. It
			reports number of primitive sequences or sequence
			functions that were inserted for rate adaptation.
			For fibre channel, each increment indicates the number
			of 4-character Primitive Sequences that
			were inserted.
			-----------------------------
			ommp81PlusInterfaceNumber:
			1 to 8 - CLIENT-1 to CLIENT-8
			-----------------------------
			Values:
			eg: 1234
			-----------------------------"
	::= { ommp81PlusPerformanceEntry 220 }

